      (pullback.fst (DRLevel.toBase N₀ q) (Spec.map (CommRingCat.ofHom ρO))) ⁻¹ᵁ ((IgusaScheme.ιFin (N₀ * q) q) ''ᵁ ⊤) := by
  classical
